#: ../../source/algorithms/fir_design.rst:127
msgid ""
"The **stopband attenuation** column is the attenuation delivered by the "
"designed filter; the **peak side lobe** column is the level of the window"
" itself, matching Table I of the article (adapted from [Harris1978]_)."
